  "title": "The first OK on a page control's Properties dialog writes PSPNLFIELDEXT.FFSTYLELONG ' | | | | '",
  "statement": "The first OK on a frame's, horizontal rule's, group box's or HTML area's Properties dialog, on a classic or a Fluid page, and on an edit box's or static text's on a Fluid page, stores the blank FFSTYLELONG as the five empty Fluid slots ' | | | | '. On a classic page a static text's dialog did not (st01 wrote ' ' over NULL).",
